  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d80488fb-70a1-409a-81df-dbbc3b8b841c.png\"></p><p><strong>Sodium Options Mod Compat</strong> 为各种与渲染相关的模组添加了Sodium视频设置，这些模组原本没有这些设置，使用了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium-options-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Options API</a>。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_81b22102-8cb4-4adc-843f-5a033bb00637.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SodiumOptionsModCompat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_7d2b55fa-b9e2-4316-9e65-5b76a7178843.png\"></p><p>目前，以下模组已兼容：</p><ul>\n<li>Entity Texture Features</li>\n<li>Entity Model Features</li>\n<li>DynamicFPS</li>\n<li>Continuity（在Fabric上原生支持，在Forge上通过Connector支持）</li>\n</ul><p>该模组部分移植自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembyui\" rel=\"nofollow\">EmbeddiumUI</a>，并增加了对其他模组的支持，同时移植为使用跨平台的 <strong>Sodium Options API</strong>，以支持以下版本：</p><ul>\n<li>Forge上的Embeddium</li>\n<li>1.20.1上的Fabric Sodium 0.5</li>\n<li>1.21.1上的Fabric/NeoForge Sodium 0.6</li>\n</ul><p>如果你有关于渲染相关模组的建议，并希望将其添加到Sodium视频设置中，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SodiumOptionsModCompat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github Issue</a> 中提交功能请求。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
